<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Drillsearch awaits Albanian oil okay.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Drillsearch awaits Albanian oil okay.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drillsearch Enegry NL said on Tuesday it was close to obtaining ministerial approval for the production sharing contract with the National Oil Corporation of Albania (Albpetrol) to redevelop two significant oil and gas fields, Cakran-Mollaj and Balish-Hekal, in southern Albania.</p>
<p>Philip Kelso said in a statement the company expects the group's oil and gas production to reach 1,500 barrels of oil equivalent per day following approval of the production sharing contract.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
